      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are some suggestions for high-energy, action-oriented labels and active verbs for each action:\n\n1. Checking account balance: \"Get Instant Update\" or \"See Your Balance Now\"\n   Active verb: \"Update\", \"View\", \"Get\"\n\n2. Sending money to a friend: \"Send & Connect\" or \"Share the Love\"\n   Active verb: \"Send\", \"Share\", \"Connect\"\n\n3. Depositing a check: \"Deposit & Earn\" or \"Cash In\"\n   Active verb: \"Deposit\", \"Earn\", \"Cash\"\n\n4. Closing an account: \"Close & Go\" or \"Free Up Yours\"\n   Active verb: \"Close\", \"Free\", \"Unlock\"\n\n5. Viewing transaction history: \"See Your Story\" or \"Unlock Your Past\"\n   Active verb: \"See\", \"Unlock\", \"Discover\"\n\nThese labels aim to evoke a sense of urgency and encourage action.",
