      "role": "user",
      "content": "these are okay, but the scores are a bit low. the tool is flagging them as too \"passive\" for our brand identity. \n\nwe need to push these way harder. don't worry about making them sound too formal or even \"calm\"—we want them to feel explosive and high-velocity. try to pack as many high-energy active verbs into each one as you can to maximize that score. \n\ngive me a new set. make them much more intense.",
      "source": "evaluator"
